{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It's Not Chess. It's Better! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To celebrate selling 50,000+ physical sets, the award-winning Australian board game, Chessplus, now gets a video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/7731acc9f248daadc41abd5cee745811.poster.avif?t=1759796145\" width=780 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/7731acc9f248daadc41abd5cee745811.webm?t=1759796145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/7731acc9f248daadc41abd5cee745811.mp4?t=1759796145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>More Possibilities. More Strategies. More Blunders.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move as either piece:\u00a0</strong>Move two pieces onto the same square using traditional chess moves to create powerful hybrids such as the &quot;Biook&quot;, Bishop + Rook, and move as a combined piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split pieces strategically:\u00a0</strong>Careful! You'll lose both your Queen + Knight if your &quot;Quight&quot; is captured, split them again for strategic positioning to capture your opponent's King.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Strategies:\u00a0</strong>Exponentially more moves than chess, open by rocketing your Rook + Pawn as a &quot;Roawn&quot; across the board for a quick promotion to make an extra Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/ebc7db07820a8eed262665e5f5cba76a.poster.avif?t=1759796145\" width=780 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/ebc7db07820a8eed262665e5f5cba76a.webm?t=1759796145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/ebc7db07820a8eed262665e5f5cba76a.mp4?t=1759796145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deckbuilder Roguelike.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Variants:\u00a0</strong>Battle progressively harder AI in different variants such as Fog of War and King of the Hill before taking on a Grandmaster boss battle.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash game-changing abilities:</strong> Craft your deck with ability cards such as &quot;Copy Cat&quot; to copy the last piece you captured or &quot;Blunder&quot; to take a turn for the opposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter:</strong>\u00a0Every run is different. Every piece you sacrifice, reward you choose or minigame you win will dramatically change the outcome of your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/6aedc038930965a0737e756d0b52c373.poster.avif?t=1759796145\" width=896 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/6aedc038930965a0737e756d0b52c373.webm?t=1759796145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/extras/6aedc038930965a0737e756d0b52c373.mp4?t=1759796145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Cross-platform Online Multiplayer.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grind your ELO:</strong>\u00a0Outwit opponents in ranked play and become the world's first Chessplus<strong>\u00a0</strong>Grandmaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete in whacky variants:</strong>\u00a0Play against your friends in custom variants such as King of the Hill with the Roguelike ability cards enabled for drafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice makes perfect:</strong> Practice your openings against our custom Chessplus<strong>\u00a0</strong>engine and review your past games to see where you blundered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3273750?t=1759796145","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/2074111196e7f617c99c4ac853b90a5aee7f156a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759796145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/73ca8e6320f4156cfd6ae8c813141c772d09ba32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759796145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273750/73ca8e6320f4156cfd6ae8c813141c772d09ba32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759796145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","deta